      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مَدْرَكٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدْرَكٌ</span> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">لَهُ مَدْرَكٌ</span> [if not a mistranscription for <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدْرِكٌ</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُدْرَكٌ</span>] means <i>He has a
sense in excess;</i> [app. <i>a preternatural perception,</i>
or <i>a second sight;</i>] and so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِرَاكَةٌ</span></b> . (TA.)

